WEBVTT

01:43.200 --> 01:44.480
Let's split up and search.

01:44.560 --> 01:45.960
This can be faster.

01:46.720 --> 01:47.640
Take my people.

01:47.720 --> 01:50.360
Their knowledge
will make your search easier.

01:50.440 --> 01:51.480
Okay.

01:55.920 --> 01:56.960
This is…

01:57.680 --> 01:59.040
Supreme wound medicine.

01:59.120 --> 02:00.800
In case you get hurt again.

02:03.480 --> 02:04.320
Thanks, Your Highness.

02:07.520 --> 02:08.360
Your Highness.

02:10.520 --> 02:13.760
Do you believe Prince Jing staged
his disappearance?

02:16.280 --> 02:18.560
Those Xiyan prisoners of war hate him.

02:19.600 --> 02:22.320
If he hides, it's for the best.

02:23.760 --> 02:24.760
Luomei,

02:27.520 --> 02:31.000
if I went missing today, would you look?

02:36.440 --> 02:38.760
Protecting the princes
is my responsibility.

02:39.720 --> 02:40.920
Personally,

02:41.000 --> 02:43.640
Your Highness, Prince Jing,
and I are childhood friends.

02:44.400 --> 02:45.280
If Your Highness vanished,

02:46.120 --> 02:48.160
I would try my best to find you.

03:00.360 --> 03:03.240
Your Highness, General Yin and His Majesty

03:04.200 --> 03:06.640
won't stop until they find Prince Jing.

03:08.120 --> 03:09.000
They…

03:12.280 --> 03:13.400
We will find him.

03:34.800 --> 03:36.520
Two more days to go.

03:39.080 --> 03:41.920
Injury makes one
more susceptible to dehydration.

03:42.000 --> 03:44.280
Let's find a shade and take a rest.

03:44.360 --> 03:45.840
Let's continue when it's dark.

03:52.600 --> 03:53.440
Just here.

04:27.480 --> 04:29.040
A bun steamed in heaven.

04:30.280 --> 04:31.320
Eat it.

04:36.880 --> 04:38.000
I don't like buns.

04:39.760 --> 04:41.320
I want to eat…

04:43.600 --> 04:44.720
I want some sugar.

04:57.200 --> 04:58.440
Eating too much sugar

04:59.600 --> 05:01.200
can lead to tooth decay.

05:02.240 --> 05:03.320
Just eat a little.

05:21.960 --> 05:23.520
What else do you want to eat?

05:24.680 --> 05:26.680
When we get out,

05:26.760 --> 05:28.080
I will

05:29.000 --> 05:30.520
get them for you.

05:31.360 --> 05:33.040
I want to eat

05:34.720 --> 05:35.560
dragon meat.

05:38.200 --> 05:39.080
Nice taste.

05:41.560 --> 05:42.640
The dragon meat

05:43.880 --> 05:45.000
is the most delicious

05:45.800 --> 05:47.520
in this world.

05:49.080 --> 05:50.840
The meat is chewy

05:52.080 --> 05:55.320
and the dragon bones can be used for stew.

06:04.480 --> 06:05.640
Are you full?

06:09.480 --> 06:10.320
Not yet.

06:13.560 --> 06:14.480
Eat more.

07:09.600 --> 07:10.640
My Lord.

07:14.440 --> 07:15.480
My Lord.

07:17.160 --> 07:18.520
My Lord.

07:18.600 --> 07:19.640
My Lord.

07:24.640 --> 07:26.480
I won't die.

07:46.440 --> 07:47.640
I won't die.

07:52.560 --> 07:53.440
Of course, you won't.

07:55.960 --> 07:58.280
A fortune-teller once told me

08:00.080 --> 08:01.720
I could live as long as 100 years.

08:28.560 --> 08:30.560
The man's here, Your Highness.

08:31.160 --> 08:33.760
I'm Cheng Rong. Greetings, Your Highness.

08:40.320 --> 08:41.360
Your Highness.

08:42.640 --> 08:45.320
Cheng Rong, who else is in your family?

08:46.200 --> 08:47.840
My mother. Two younger brothers.

08:49.520 --> 08:50.360
Okay.

08:51.760 --> 08:52.600
Rest assured.

08:52.680 --> 08:55.320
I will look after them from now on.

08:56.280 --> 08:57.320
Thanks, Your Highness.

08:57.400 --> 09:00.880
I pledge to serve Your Highness
wholeheartedly, even to death.

09:02.760 --> 09:04.000
You…

09:04.080 --> 09:05.240
Help!

09:06.720 --> 09:07.640
Jinghe,

09:08.520 --> 09:09.760
I've finally found you.

09:22.040 --> 09:23.760
Someone reported, Your Highness.

09:24.360 --> 09:26.320
General Yin found the path
on the Sunset Cliff.

09:28.080 --> 09:29.200
You handle the rest.

09:29.960 --> 09:31.440
Don't give yourself away.

09:32.480 --> 09:33.520
Understood.

09:41.120 --> 09:43.760
Didn't expect snow
in this year's late spring cold snap.

09:43.840 --> 09:44.680
Right.

09:44.760 --> 09:46.600
This year is much colder than before.

09:47.320 --> 09:48.520
Winter snow is precious.

09:49.960 --> 09:51.280
Spring snow's never good.

09:53.120 --> 09:55.280
Lushan's had hunts for over a decade

09:55.360 --> 09:56.640
but never snowed this heavily.

09:57.800 --> 10:00.080
I'm afraid Prince Jing can't return.

11:32.960 --> 11:33.800
My Lord.

11:48.040 --> 11:48.880
My Lord.

11:51.840 --> 11:52.720
Wake up.

11:56.560 --> 11:57.400
My Lord.

11:59.080 --> 12:02.640
Qingzhou, the true culprit is not dead.

12:04.600 --> 12:05.680
You are not qualified to sleep.

12:06.960 --> 12:08.280
Get up.

12:12.120 --> 12:14.960
Your Weibei Army,

12:16.200 --> 12:18.000
the civilians in Qingzhou,

12:21.120 --> 12:23.240
pay back

12:25.200 --> 12:26.920
what you owe them yourself.

12:35.400 --> 12:38.720
I also owe you.

12:40.960 --> 12:42.680
You owe me the dragon meat

12:45.080 --> 12:46.720
and the fruit cake shop.

12:49.520 --> 12:51.120
You must give them to me.

12:55.920 --> 12:57.480
I'll pay back

12:58.840 --> 13:00.000
what I owe you

13:01.080 --> 13:01.920
in my

13:03.160 --> 13:04.000
next

13:05.680 --> 13:06.640
life.

13:07.920 --> 13:08.760
My Lord.

13:10.080 --> 13:10.960
My Lord.

13:13.640 --> 13:14.480
Jinghe.

13:16.000 --> 13:17.000
Jinghe.

13:20.320 --> 13:21.640
Murong Jinghe.

13:23.440 --> 13:24.600
Jinghe.

13:25.680 --> 13:26.680
Get up.

13:29.280 --> 13:30.320
Get up.

14:49.240 --> 14:50.560
Jinghe.

14:52.840 --> 14:54.160
Murong Jinghe.

14:56.680 --> 14:57.960
Jinghe.

15:04.080 --> 15:04.920
Luomei,

15:13.680 --> 15:14.840
Jinghe

15:17.160 --> 15:18.000
has been found.

16:08.280 --> 16:09.240
Don't worry, Your Highness.

16:09.840 --> 16:12.680
I'm used to seeing people dying.
I won't lose my composure.

16:40.280 --> 16:41.360
How did it happen?

16:44.480 --> 16:45.800
The guards said

16:45.880 --> 16:48.280
the snow crushed the rocks
and it happened.

16:49.120 --> 16:51.960
He was disfigured when he was found.

16:54.080 --> 16:55.040
No,

16:56.640 --> 16:57.760
he is not Jinghe.

17:10.040 --> 17:10.880
This is Jinghe?

17:12.040 --> 17:14.359
Father, I can't believe it either.

17:27.440 --> 17:28.280
That's…

17:30.840 --> 17:33.800
That's the ring
Empress Dejia had left to Jinghe.

17:35.880 --> 17:36.840
- Your Majesty.
- Father.

17:38.800 --> 17:40.720
Luomei, Father's health is the priority.

17:40.800 --> 17:42.840
Escort His Majesty
and Concubine Yan back to Zhaojing.

17:43.440 --> 17:44.280
As for Jinghe,

17:45.360 --> 17:46.320
I will send him back home.

17:47.160 --> 17:48.000
No,

17:48.880 --> 17:49.960
he is not Jinghe.

17:51.080 --> 17:51.920
Jinghe is not dead.

17:52.000 --> 17:53.160
He's waiting to be found.

17:53.240 --> 17:54.080
General Yin,

17:55.160 --> 17:56.040
as a general,

17:56.120 --> 17:58.440
adhere to the duties and think big.

18:00.520 --> 18:02.680
Escort His Majesty back.
Set off immediately.

18:03.440 --> 18:06.200
My order ̀as Crown Prince.

18:20.160 --> 18:21.000
I will

18:22.520 --> 18:23.760
follow your command.

18:24.480 --> 18:27.600
Your Majesty. Your Majesty.
Your Majesty, please.

18:27.680 --> 18:28.720
Come.

18:35.800 --> 18:36.760
You must find Prince Jing.

18:37.520 --> 18:40.120
Dead or alive, I must see him.

19:56.480 --> 19:57.320
Mei Lin.

20:01.360 --> 20:02.760
My Lord.

20:03.600 --> 20:04.640
Miss Mei Lin.

20:05.320 --> 20:06.640
Qingyan.

20:09.960 --> 20:11.680
Mei Lin. Mei Lin.

20:11.760 --> 20:14.640
XIYAN IMPERIAL PALACE

20:21.920 --> 20:22.880
Mr. Yue Qin.

20:23.600 --> 20:25.760
Didn't Yunqi have someone send you home?

20:26.280 --> 20:27.120
What happened?

20:27.960 --> 20:28.800
I…

20:30.960 --> 20:34.040
Mr. Yue Qin,
Jia's father sold her to a pub.

20:34.920 --> 20:36.320
I took pains to help her escape.

20:36.920 --> 20:38.480
But my father can't accept her.

20:38.560 --> 20:41.040
We have no choice but to seek your help.

20:41.120 --> 20:44.040
Please spare her life,
even as a palace servant.

20:46.720 --> 20:47.920
Will you marry?

20:48.480 --> 20:50.200
The An family's third son is unmarried.

20:50.920 --> 20:52.840
Although his rank is low,
he's an upright man,

20:53.480 --> 20:54.640
trustworthy with your life.

20:55.440 --> 20:56.680
Thanks, Mr. Yue.

20:56.760 --> 20:58.360
Jia, quickly thank Mr. Yue.

20:59.840 --> 21:01.720
Mr. Yue, I won't marry.

21:02.400 --> 21:05.400
Jia, with your current situation,

21:05.480 --> 21:07.320
marrying Mr. An is the best choice.

21:08.560 --> 21:10.560
I used to think beauty alone

21:10.640 --> 21:13.680
would secure a wealthy life
through marriage.

21:13.760 --> 21:16.640
But now I see relying on others

21:16.720 --> 21:18.280
only brings fear,

21:18.360 --> 21:19.720
one mistake could cost your life.

21:20.520 --> 21:22.400
Mr. Yue, I won't marry.

21:22.480 --> 21:25.240
I want to learn skills from you
to stand on my own.

21:26.560 --> 21:28.440
I'll help if you want to learn.

21:32.040 --> 21:33.800
- Thank you, Mr. Yue Qin.
- Thank you, Mr. Yue Qin.

21:33.880 --> 21:34.720
This way, please.

21:45.680 --> 21:48.480
LAOWOZI VILLAGE

21:57.880 --> 21:58.760
Lord?

21:59.320 --> 22:01.120
Lord. You're awake, my Lord.

22:11.400 --> 22:12.360
Mei Lin.

22:16.080 --> 22:17.240
How is she?

22:17.320 --> 22:19.960
Don't worry, my Lord.
Miss Mei is fine. Here.

22:23.600 --> 22:24.760
Slowly.

22:25.520 --> 22:27.520
The physician examined her just now.
She is fine.

22:28.200 --> 22:29.960
She woke up once a few hours ago

22:30.040 --> 22:32.280
and had some rice porridge.

22:32.360 --> 22:33.600
She is just sleeping now.

22:37.640 --> 22:40.240
Her hand held yours tightly,

22:40.320 --> 22:41.560
impossible to pry loose.

22:47.680 --> 22:48.520
Mei Lin,

22:50.800 --> 22:51.680
we have won.

22:53.120 --> 22:53.960
We have really won.

23:26.440 --> 23:27.800
I won't die.

23:29.280 --> 23:30.960
Of course, you won't.

23:31.040 --> 23:33.440
A fortune-teller once told me

23:33.520 --> 23:35.240
I could live as long as 100 years.

23:37.000 --> 23:38.320
My Lord.

23:44.920 --> 23:46.040
Qingzhou,

23:46.680 --> 23:48.320
the true culprit is not dead.

23:48.920 --> 23:50.160
You are not qualified to sleep.

23:51.080 --> 23:52.440
Get up.

23:54.440 --> 23:55.560
Jinghe.

23:59.560 --> 24:01.000
She is really fine.

24:01.080 --> 24:03.400
Assassins often go days without sleep.

24:04.080 --> 24:07.520
Once they're out of danger,
they catch up on sleep.

24:07.600 --> 24:09.400
Miss Mei was a great help this time.

24:10.000 --> 24:11.800
She went nearly three days
without food or drink.

24:12.400 --> 24:15.040
Even the elite Weibei Army
couldn't match her.

24:15.640 --> 24:17.960
She stayed on guard with a dagger

24:18.880 --> 24:22.040
and only collapsed when she
realized it was me.

24:23.560 --> 24:24.760
The physician said

24:25.400 --> 24:27.880
her body seemed divinely blessed,

24:27.960 --> 24:29.200
even death wouldn't touch her.

24:29.280 --> 24:32.720
She turned a dead end into survival.

24:34.240 --> 24:35.080
Survival

24:36.280 --> 24:38.280
is never given by the gods.

24:39.840 --> 24:41.440
It is always forged by people themselves.

24:50.120 --> 24:51.680
I'm Lord Lao.

24:57.680 --> 24:58.960
Forget it.

24:59.040 --> 25:02.640
Tell Prince Jing this man can be cured.

25:02.720 --> 25:04.720
But it takes time.

25:04.800 --> 25:05.640
Go ahead.

25:28.400 --> 25:30.880
Greetings, Father.

25:34.000 --> 25:35.800
KING OF XIYAN

25:39.040 --> 25:41.440
ZHU LI, HIGH PRIEST OF XIYAN

25:50.640 --> 25:54.040
These are the farming skills
I learned in the Yan Dynasty.

25:55.320 --> 25:57.360
Xiyan's land is fertile
and produces abundantly.

25:57.960 --> 26:00.240
If Xiyan people can learn farming skills,

26:00.840 --> 26:04.440
the civilians won't suffer
from hunger anymore.

26:09.240 --> 26:11.520
ESSENTIALS OF WEIQI COMMENTARY

26:15.680 --> 26:16.680
Before leaving,

26:16.760 --> 26:19.560
the Emperor of Great Yan
gave me this Weiqi Game Record.

26:20.320 --> 26:22.880
He also told me
Weiqi embodies Yin and Yang,

26:23.480 --> 26:24.560
guided by Dao.

26:25.440 --> 26:28.080
If a ruler can study the art of Weiqi,

26:28.160 --> 26:30.000
it would greatly benefit governance.

26:43.760 --> 26:44.600
Stop!

26:45.840 --> 26:46.680
Your Highness,

26:47.520 --> 26:50.280
the celestial signs indicate
an impending disaster in Xiyan.

26:51.640 --> 26:54.440
The King is in seclusion
to avert the calamity

26:55.080 --> 26:56.520
and must not be disturbed.

26:57.280 --> 26:59.920
So, I was appointed
to handle the affairs of the state.

27:02.760 --> 27:05.680
Can the farming skills
and the principles of governance

27:06.280 --> 27:07.520
help avert the calamity?

27:08.800 --> 27:11.120
Madam, what is the calamity?

27:12.320 --> 27:15.560
The King has been ordained
by the heavenly deities.

27:16.160 --> 27:19.320
The King's mortality is the calamity.

27:27.640 --> 27:30.320
Mr. Yue, I've inquired about it.

27:30.400 --> 27:32.960
The current High Priest
is Prince Pingyang's eldest daughter,

27:33.480 --> 27:34.320
Zhu Li.

27:35.560 --> 27:37.680
The King has abandoned state affairs
for years,

27:37.760 --> 27:39.040
focusing on longevity

27:39.800 --> 27:41.200
and consulting numerous priests.

27:41.760 --> 27:45.320
Yet he trusts only one in the end.

27:48.440 --> 27:49.320
Zhu Li?

27:55.680 --> 27:56.800
Who?

27:59.920 --> 28:00.760
Greetings, Your Highness.

28:00.840 --> 28:03.320
I'm Zhu Li.
I'm Prince Pingyang's daughter.

28:04.240 --> 28:05.640
What were you doing just now?

28:06.320 --> 28:09.040
My father says the Longevity Lamp,
transformed from a celestial deity,

28:09.120 --> 28:10.560
will never be extinguished.

28:10.640 --> 28:13.000
But I wonder if it truly never goes out.

28:14.920 --> 28:16.160
Aren't you afraid of divine punishment?

28:17.240 --> 28:18.480
I don't believe in gods.

28:19.080 --> 28:21.880
Today, my mother punished me
because I don't believe in gods.

28:21.960 --> 28:22.800
I'd like to see

28:23.400 --> 28:26.120
what happens when the lamp's blown out.

28:33.440 --> 28:36.280
It seems the gods are not as terrible
as my mother.

28:54.880 --> 28:55.960
Madam.

29:00.200 --> 29:02.120
Why do you come to the altar?

29:02.880 --> 29:04.760
The people of Xiyan suffer

29:05.640 --> 29:07.400
while the royal court

29:08.440 --> 29:09.800
spends tens of thousands

29:10.400 --> 29:12.960
on mermaid oil

29:13.040 --> 29:14.760
to keep the lamps lit.

29:15.360 --> 29:17.640
This is far too extravagant of you.

29:19.360 --> 29:21.080
Please be cautious with your words.

29:22.000 --> 29:24.560
The Longevity Lamp
is transformed from a celestial deity.

29:25.160 --> 29:27.000
Only by keeping it burning

29:27.080 --> 29:29.640
can the King's reign endure forever.

29:32.720 --> 29:34.200
But you are not

29:34.280 --> 29:36.680
a guardian chosen by the deities.

29:37.400 --> 29:39.000
How dare you!

29:39.080 --> 29:40.640
Twenty years ago,

29:40.720 --> 29:43.160
Prince Pingyang's twin daughters
were born.

29:43.240 --> 29:44.760
The elder sister's Zhu Li.

29:44.840 --> 29:47.720
Her birth chart
aligned with Father's heavenly mandate,

29:47.800 --> 29:49.880
a blessing of fortune and prosperity
bestowed by the heavens.

29:50.560 --> 29:53.640
And you, the younger daughter Zhu Shun,

29:54.320 --> 29:57.680
hating the injustice of heaven
and jealous of your sister,

29:57.760 --> 30:00.960
killed her with your own hands
and took her place.

30:01.040 --> 30:03.160
Nonsense! I'm Zhu Li.

30:03.760 --> 30:05.760
How can you slander me without proof?

30:08.720 --> 30:10.800
It concerns my Father's longevity.

30:10.880 --> 30:12.160
Whether you're Zhu Li or Zhu Shun,

30:12.760 --> 30:14.280
he'll find out.

30:16.400 --> 30:17.600
Don't worry.

30:17.680 --> 30:18.880
I will

30:19.680 --> 30:21.200
keep your secret for you.

30:22.320 --> 30:23.280
I've heard my second brother, Yue Chu,

30:24.000 --> 30:25.480
has been trying to win you over in secret.

30:26.400 --> 30:29.800
I hope you can assess the situation
carefully and make decisive moves.

30:34.160 --> 30:35.640
I only follow the King's orders.

30:39.680 --> 30:41.160
Since you have discerned heaven,

30:41.920 --> 30:44.120
earth, deities, and humans,

30:44.200 --> 30:47.360
you should know immortality is a delusion.

30:47.440 --> 30:50.520
If one persists in delusions,
the nation will be harmed.

30:51.440 --> 30:53.920
How can the priests find peace
with Xiyan's stability at risk?

30:54.880 --> 30:56.360
If I become Xiyan's young ruler,

30:57.120 --> 30:58.720
ensuring its long-term stability,

30:58.800 --> 31:00.800
the position of the priests can endure.

31:10.560 --> 31:11.440
You're back.

31:12.800 --> 31:14.280
You're back. Off to work?

31:16.600 --> 31:18.120
- Come on. Take this.
- I want one, too.

31:18.200 --> 31:19.040
Careful. Don't fall.

31:19.120 --> 31:20.560
- Let Sister play.
- Busy working?

31:24.640 --> 31:25.640
Where's everybody?

31:26.320 --> 31:29.160
The Crown Prince reported your death
using a fake corpse.

31:29.240 --> 31:31.720
His Majesty believed
and withdrew the Imperial Guards,

31:31.800 --> 31:34.960
leaving only the Crown Prince's men
watching your mansion.

31:35.040 --> 31:37.720
I feared causing you trouble…
I acted in secret.

31:38.840 --> 31:42.440
Spreading the news about my death
before killing me.

31:45.280 --> 31:46.720
Where's this?

31:46.800 --> 31:48.560
This is Laowozi Village deep in Zhongshan.

31:48.640 --> 31:49.840
Villagers are refugees
from the previous dynasty.

31:49.920 --> 31:52.160
This village is hidden,
even from the government.

31:52.240 --> 31:55.360
Rest assured, my Lord.
I accidentally found this place.

31:56.120 --> 31:58.680
I wiped away our traces of coming here.

31:58.760 --> 32:01.000
The villagers think we are refugees
fleeing from war.

32:01.080 --> 32:02.600
They kindly offered us a shelter
to recover.

32:06.920 --> 32:07.760
How is Li Qing?

32:08.560 --> 32:09.640
He went mad.

32:09.720 --> 32:11.400
The physician said he'll recover.

32:11.480 --> 32:12.720
But it takes time.

32:14.000 --> 32:15.920
My Lord, I'll gather secret guards,

32:16.000 --> 32:17.640
risking our lives to escort you.

32:17.720 --> 32:18.560
There's no need for sacrifices.

32:19.440 --> 32:20.440
Use their plan.

32:20.520 --> 32:23.960
I'll hide in Laowozi Village
and let the Crown Prince search

32:24.040 --> 32:25.280
until Li Qing recovers.

32:25.360 --> 32:27.840
Once Li Qing's awake,
I'll return to see His Majesty.

32:27.920 --> 32:30.400
A few secret guards will protect you.

32:30.480 --> 32:32.920
No need. Mei Lin is enough.

32:33.000 --> 32:35.160
You return immediately.
Arrange my funeral.

32:35.240 --> 32:37.560
For my safety, make it convincing.

32:38.360 --> 32:39.280
Okay.

32:39.360 --> 32:41.280
Well, I'll leave once Mei Lin wakes.

32:41.360 --> 32:42.880
I have something to tell her.

32:44.160 --> 32:47.000
- About what?
- To look after you.

32:47.080 --> 32:48.800
Although your external injuries are fine,

32:48.880 --> 32:50.480
your lack of food and water has weakened

32:50.560 --> 32:51.880
your spleen and stomach.

32:51.960 --> 32:53.880
- Avoid raw and cold foods.
- Fine.

32:53.960 --> 32:56.280
I can look after myself. Hurry back.

32:57.320 --> 32:58.880
My Lord, I've left the usual medicines

32:58.960 --> 33:01.640
for you in the room,
along with the sleeping powder.

33:01.720 --> 33:03.560
The physician warned
that you must not exceed

33:03.640 --> 33:05.920
one spoonful of the sleeping powder
per day,

33:06.000 --> 33:07.520
or you might depend on them forever.

33:07.600 --> 33:08.920
Haven't you finished?

33:09.000 --> 33:11.400
Your stay risks my safety. Hurry back.

33:12.600 --> 33:14.640
Yes. I'm leaving.

33:20.360 --> 33:22.840
Hasn't your wife woken up yet?

33:23.520 --> 33:24.600
Thank you for these days.

33:26.440 --> 33:27.760
It's strange.

33:28.280 --> 33:29.480
She can sleep for so long.

33:30.840 --> 33:33.000
She can eat and drink but won't wake up.

33:33.080 --> 33:34.080
Oh, right.

33:34.160 --> 33:35.680
The porridge is on the stove.

33:35.760 --> 33:37.720
- Okay. Thanks, Madam.
- I'll get busy.

34:36.440 --> 34:37.600
You're dreaming again.

34:41.639 --> 34:43.560
How much longer will you sleep?

34:47.320 --> 34:49.120
Are you deliberately tormenting me?

34:51.000 --> 34:51.920
Father,

34:53.639 --> 34:54.480
Mother,

34:57.280 --> 34:58.280
sugar figure.

35:04.000 --> 35:05.320
No wonder…

35:08.000 --> 35:08.960
I want more.

35:17.080 --> 35:20.000
Not too much. You'll get tooth decay.

35:25.920 --> 35:26.880
Father,

35:30.000 --> 35:31.200
sing a song.

35:33.520 --> 35:34.720
Sing a song.

35:44.520 --> 35:48.120
In February

35:49.000 --> 35:51.720
The peach blossoms are red

35:52.280 --> 35:55.080
The pear flowers are white

36:05.680 --> 36:08.640
In February

36:08.720 --> 36:14.080
The peach blossoms are red
The pear flowers are white

36:15.400 --> 36:18.160
Rapeseed flowers

36:18.760 --> 36:21.280
Bloom all over the field

36:22.120 --> 36:25.800
Willow leaves are like green silk cuttings

36:29.000 --> 36:30.240
Was it a dream?

36:33.320 --> 36:34.160
Yes.

36:39.920 --> 36:40.760
Go on singing.

36:45.800 --> 36:47.840
In February

36:48.640 --> 36:51.400
The peach blossoms are red

36:51.480 --> 36:53.600
The pear flowers are white

36:54.520 --> 36:55.360
Apricot flowers.

36:56.880 --> 36:57.880
What apricot flowers?

36:59.160 --> 37:00.760
Peach blossoms are red.

37:00.840 --> 37:01.840
Apricot flowers are white.

37:04.280 --> 37:07.200
You sang pear flowers are white.
You're wrong.

37:09.960 --> 37:12.440
I wasn't wrong. You were dreaming again.

37:14.720 --> 37:15.560
A dream?

37:16.880 --> 37:18.440
But I clearly heard your voice just now.

37:20.920 --> 37:22.880
- The young lady is awake.
- Madam.

37:22.960 --> 37:25.280
Your husband was so worried about you.

37:25.360 --> 37:26.720
When you were sleeping,

37:26.800 --> 37:28.720
you said you wanted sugar figures.

37:28.800 --> 37:31.200
There are no such things in our place.

37:31.280 --> 37:32.640
Your husband got wild honey

37:32.720 --> 37:34.560
to coax you to sleep.

37:34.640 --> 37:35.920
Here. I've added some in this.

37:36.520 --> 37:37.640
- It's really sweet.
- Let me.

37:39.600 --> 37:42.120
What happened to your hand?
Were you stung by a bee?

37:43.480 --> 37:44.320
It doesn't matter.

37:44.920 --> 37:46.200
Here. Drink it.

37:48.120 --> 37:50.960
Just feed her. Feed your wife.

37:59.520 --> 38:01.840
Madam, actually, we are not…

38:03.440 --> 38:04.360
We…

38:07.200 --> 38:08.600
We're siblings who survived a calamity.

38:09.320 --> 38:10.360
We're grateful for your help.

38:10.440 --> 38:12.200
We'll repay you in the future.

38:12.760 --> 38:16.080
So, you are siblings? Aren't you a couple?

38:16.600 --> 38:19.280
Our parents died of illnesses long ago.

38:19.360 --> 38:20.640
As her brother,

38:20.720 --> 38:22.920
I have to take care of her.

38:24.480 --> 38:26.600
You have also had a tough life.

38:26.680 --> 38:29.320
But you are fortunate
to have found our place.

38:29.400 --> 38:31.680
You can live here as long as you want.

38:32.520 --> 38:35.200
Madam, since my sister is awake,

38:35.280 --> 38:36.280
we need to get the physician.

38:36.360 --> 38:38.880
Right. She needs the physician.

38:38.960 --> 38:41.480
- I'll go.
- Madam, no need.

38:42.240 --> 38:44.640
We'll go see him later.

38:44.720 --> 38:47.240
Right. Your brother's hand
needs to be treated.

38:48.120 --> 38:49.080
I'm leaving.

38:49.160 --> 38:51.200
- Go on eating.
- Okay.

39:19.720 --> 39:21.480
- They don't seem local.
- Never seem them.

39:21.560 --> 39:23.400
Are they from around here?

39:24.640 --> 39:26.040
Was it a bee sting?

39:27.320 --> 39:29.600
The groundweed root
should reduce swelling.

39:30.480 --> 39:32.320
The physician will have it.

39:32.840 --> 39:33.680
Fine.

39:35.080 --> 39:36.360
There's honey in the porridge.

39:37.440 --> 39:38.280
It's sweet.

39:40.200 --> 39:42.720
Thanks to you, I have survived.

39:43.320 --> 39:46.120
I should satisfy your cravings
for good food.

39:48.400 --> 39:49.240
Mei Lin,

39:50.920 --> 39:51.800
once we return,

39:52.400 --> 39:54.520
I'll grant you whatever you wish.

39:55.960 --> 39:57.440
We are allies.

39:58.880 --> 40:00.200
Helping you was to help myself.

40:02.960 --> 40:03.800
So,

40:04.840 --> 40:07.640
you'll continue with me, right?

40:10.400 --> 40:11.800
We have the same goal.

40:12.440 --> 40:13.760
Even if we get lost,

40:15.480 --> 40:16.960
we must move forward together.

40:24.000 --> 40:26.040
The Crown Prince faked my death.

40:26.600 --> 40:29.320
Now Murong Jinghe is a dead man.

40:30.120 --> 40:31.400
Once Li Qing is cured,

40:31.480 --> 40:34.560
we can return to Zhaojing
to settle scores with him.

40:35.480 --> 40:37.520
Concubine Yan will surely search for me

40:37.600 --> 40:39.000
now that I'm missing.

40:40.040 --> 40:41.080
Will the Crown Prince trouble her?

40:43.360 --> 40:44.320
At the Lushan Hunting Ground,

40:44.400 --> 40:46.520
more than one person saw us together.

40:47.080 --> 40:50.720
They'll guess I was with you
when the accident happened.

40:50.800 --> 40:52.920
You might be the only one with the truth.

40:54.520 --> 40:56.120
Even if Concubine Yan's silent,

40:56.200 --> 40:57.640
Father will send searchers for you.

40:58.480 --> 41:00.120
With my Father's people around,

41:00.200 --> 41:02.600
the Crown Prince will think twice
before doing anything.

41:03.560 --> 41:04.600
It's a good thing for us.

41:06.800 --> 41:09.440
In all, before Li Qing is cured,

41:09.520 --> 41:11.040
we just need to hide in the village

41:11.720 --> 41:13.680
as a pair of common refugee siblings.

41:14.680 --> 41:16.400
- My Lord.
- Call me Jinghe.

41:19.640 --> 41:20.680
Jinghe.

41:24.040 --> 41:24.960
Is this place safe?

41:28.880 --> 41:30.320
A perfect escape.
